  The reel_script says the camp is held at the 'Coimbatore agri university campus' (கோவை வேளாண் பல்கலை வளாகத்தில்) and the slides say 'தமிழ்நாடு வேளாண் பல்கலை வளாகத்தில்' — the article says only 'பல்கலை வளாகத்தில' (the university campus); the city attribution is an addition, though Coimbatore is the dateline.
  The reel_script says the training is 'for agricultural professors' and slides_spec headline 'வேளாண் பேராசிரியர்களுக்கு' — acceptable, but the tamil_headline states the camp started at 'கோவை பல்கலை வளாகத்தில்' which is consistent with the article only loosely; no major factual error here.
  The reel_script omits the fact that the forestry college dean is named 'பாலசுப்பிரமணியன்' with his title only partially — the article's title is 'வனக்கல்லூரி மற்றும் ஆராய்ச்சி நிலைய டீன்', which the reel_script renders with the correct title, so this is not a problem.
  The slides_spec line 'பேராசிரியர்களின் அறிவு, திறன், கற்பித்தல் ஆற்றல் மேம்பாடு' and the reel_script are accurate; however the slide 'யார் ஏற்பாடு?' (who organized) is a mislabel: the article only says the camp was held 'சார்பில்' by the Planning and Monitoring Directorate, so 'ஏற்பாடு' is a reasonable reading but the slide attributes the camp to the directorate, which matches the article.
