  The caption says the buyer 'கேட்டபோதும் வக்கீல் நோட்டீஸ் அனுப்பிய பின்பும்' — the article says a legal notice was sent, and the supermarket did not respond; the caption attributes the failed response to both asking and the notice, which is acceptable.
